  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fond f&#xf6;r samarbete med det colombianska civilsamh&#xe4;llet, FOS 2014-2020</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund for cooperation with the Colombian society, FOS, 2014-2020 - Refund to Norway, share of funding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FOS is a joint Swedish-Norwegian Fund for support to colombian civil society. The fund aims to contribute to (i) the strengthening of the peace process in the country; (ii) the empowerment of victims of the conflict and human rights defenders; and (iii) the strengthening of democracy in relation to peacebuilding.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FOS &#xe4;r en svensk-norsk fond f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till colombianska civilsamh&#xe4;llet. Fondens m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att bidra till (i) st&#xe4;rkandet av fredsprocessen i landet; (ii) st&#xe4;rkande av konfliktens offer samt f&#xf6;rsvarare av m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter; samt (iii) st&#xe4;rkt demokrati i relation till fredsbyggande.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The outcome objectives of the Fund are the following:1. Civil society has contributed to enhance the peace process on local, regional and national level.2. Civil society has contributed to the empowerment of victims and human rights defenders.3. Civil society has contributed to strengthened democracy on local, regional and national level in relation to peace building.</narrative>
  </description>
